 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Keys and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are in the data as `apiKeys`
+(`{ key, name, role }`).
+
+- `viewer`: GET requests only.
+- `cook`: also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures` and `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything, including `GET /audit`.
+
+No key or an unknown key is 401 `unauthorized`; a key without permission is
+403 `forbidden`.
+
+## Audit
+
+Every request with a known key that is not a GET adds an entry
+`{ at, key, method, path, status }` to `audit`. `GET /audit` lists them newest
+first (managers only).
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
